# Waypoint UI

- Follow the supplied Figma design and `docs/DESIGN_REFERENCE.md`. Use Waypoint design tokens (`styles/tokens.css`), never raw colours.
- shadcn/ui provides primitives, not the visual design. The app must not look like default shadcn.
- Preserve role-specific layouts:
  - Dispatcher: desktop-first (1440 px), information dense.
  - Loader: tablet-first (768 px), large touch targets.
  - Driver: mobile-first (360-414 px), one dominant action per screen, 48 px targets.
  - Store Manager: responsive desktop and mobile.
- Status never relies on colour alone: icon plus label, via the shared `StatusBadge`.
- Predicted, recommended, observed, risk and hard-violation states stay visually distinct.
- Render every time through the shared Asia/Colombo formatter.
